<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Task Difficulty Partition for MetaWorld MT50</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We follow the difficulty partition of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">36</a>]</cite> and group the 50 MetaWorld tasks into four tiers according to manipulation complexity (Tab. <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix A Task Difficulty Partition for MetaWorld MT50 ‣ One Token Per Frame: Reconsidering Visual Bandwidth in World Models for VLA Policy" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>). All MetaWorld results in the main paper are reported per tier and as the macro-average across tiers.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Task difficulty partition for MetaWorld MT50, following <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">36</a>]</cite>.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
