</figure>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Short-Horizon Results on MetaWorld MT50</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The main paper focuses on long-horizon evaluation. For completeness, Tab. <a href="#A7.T15" title="Table 15 ‣ Appendix G Short-Horizon Results on MetaWorld MT50 ‣ One Token Per Frame: Reconsidering Visual Bandwidth in World Models for VLA Policy" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> reports the short-horizon setting (action horizon <math id="A7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>10</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10</annotation></semantics></math> for both training and inference). OneWM-VLA reaches the best average success and the best Very Hard success in this setting as well, showing that the design carries over to the short-horizon setting as well in our evaluation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T15" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 15: </span>Short-horizon results on MetaWorld MT50. All methods use action horizon <math id="A7.T15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>10</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10</annotation></semantics></math> for both training and inference.</figcaption>
<table id="A7.T15.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A7.T15.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A7.T15.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.25pt;padding-bottom:0.25pt;"><span id="A7.T15.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Method</span></th>
<th id="A7.T15.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.25pt;padding-bottom:0.25pt;"><span id="A7.T15.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Easy</span></th>
<th id="A7.T15.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.25pt;padding-bottom:0.25pt;"><span id="A7.T15.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Medium</span></th>
<th id="A7.T15.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.25pt;padding-bottom:0.25pt;"><span id="A7.T15.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Hard</span></th>
<th id="A7.T15.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.25pt;padding-bottom:0.25pt;"><span id="A7.T15.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Very Hard</span></th>
<th id="A7.T15.2.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.25pt;padding-bottom:0.25pt;"><span id="A7.T15.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Avg%</span></th></tr>
</thead>
